{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110410001:1":{"text":"처음 군가 축제에 참가해 <style=\"highlight\">피의 시련</style>과 <style=\"highlight\">영혼의 시련</style>을 통과했다고 들었어.","source_cn":"有人告诉我，你初次参赛，就通过了<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FACDC562E71393C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110410002:1":{"text":"게다가 브루투스까지 널 칭찬했고. 블랙하울 부족은 약자를 싫어할 뿐이야. 하지만 넌 실력으로 너의 강인함을 증명했지.","source_cn":"连布鲁特斯都称赞了你，黑嚎氏族厌弃的只是弱者。而你，已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA95D28B72BE44E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110410003:1":{"text":"나 오우거가 블랙하울의 보스로서 널 초대하겠다...","source_cn":"现在，我奥格作为黑嚎氏族的首领，向你发出邀请——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10787B417C2CC33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110410004:1":{"text":"저를 블랙하울로... 돌아오도록요?","source_cn":"邀请我……回到黑嚎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x536FEEC6BDEAE977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110410005:1":{"text":"강자는 강자와 함께해야 해. 난 그 점을 누구보다도 잘 알지.","source_cn":"强者，该与强者为伍。我比任何人都理解这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB74491DFD7229AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110410006:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">블랙하울 부족이 강인한 이유</style>? 우린 적을 짓밟을 때마다, 이렇게 비명을 지르곤 하지...","source_cn":"<style=highlight>黑嚎氏族为何如此强大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74308B3C5ECF5710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110410007:1":{"text":"...정말 역겹도록 강인하군요.","source_cn":"……真是令人厌恶的强大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE77BB24322F2FA71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110410008:1":{"text":"소렌, 넌 아직 어려서 몰라... 트라이브 모두 피와 살로 이루어진 몸을 가졌는데, 어째서 누구는 약하고 누구는 강한 걸까?","source_cn":"索恩，你还年轻，不懂得……蛮血都是血肉之躯，为何有人弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E4C5167C2C258EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110410009:1":{"text":"답은 아주 간단해. 강자는 힘을 위해서 모든 것을 포기할 수 있기 때문이지.","source_cn":"答案很简单。强者为了追逐力量，可以抛弃一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF01C61BFCDC699B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110410010:1":{"text":"하지만 약자는 어리석고 욕심이 많아. 그들은 모든 것을... “보호”하고 손에 쥐려고 하지.","source_cn":"弱者则愚蠢又贪婪，他们什么都想……“保护”，想要抓在手心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B315F36B759E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110410011:1":{"text":"그게 잘못된 건가요?","source_cn":"这又有什么错？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25ED5B6CBF9FCDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110410012:1":{"text":"아르사, 맞지? 굉장히 잘못된 거야. 약자의 허황된 약속은 의미가 없어.","source_cn":"阿尔萨，是吗？大错特错，弱者虚伪的诺言没有意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB892A7FDE3C447","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110410013:1":{"text":"이 잔인하고 메마른 땅에서 약해빠진 육체와 의지는 불리할 수밖에 없어.","source_cn":"在这片残酷的贫瘠之地，脆弱的身体和虚弱的意志注定处于劣势。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72700C97F78CC713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110410014:1":{"text":"블랙하울 부족으로 돌아와, 소렌. 우리 부족은 그런 나약한 곳이 아니라는 걸 장담하지.","source_cn":"回归氏族吧，索恩。我向你保证，黑嚎氏族不是那种软弱的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AFB84BD9383F556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110410015:1":{"text":"이곳은 강자가 즐비해서 힘으로만 말하지. 네가 충분히 강하다면 두려울 게 없을 거야.","source_cn":"这里强者林立，只靠力量说话。只要你足够强，便能无所顾忌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F34192BC198D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110410016:1":{"text":"싫어요.","source_cn":"不要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA7C6B34B88BA56D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110410017:1":{"text":"...흠. 강자의 신중함인가? 하지만 그때의 일을 그렇게 원망한다면 그건 강자의 도량이 아니야.","source_cn":"……哼，强者的矜持，是吗？但你如此记恨当年的事，这就不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA9304E2BCBBC9DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110410018:1":{"text":"만약 나약함을 용납했다면 블랙하울 부족은 여기까지 못 왔을 거야. 언젠가 네가 내 위치에 오른다면 넌 나보다 더욱...","source_cn":"如果容忍软弱，黑嚎氏族不会走到今天。如果有一天，你处在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2866508295C6AB30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110410019:1":{"text":"꿈 깨세요, 오우거. 그런 날은 오지 않아요.","source_cn":"别妄想了，奥格。不会有那一天的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCD864FEC26E1622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110410020:1":{"text":"저도 제 부족이 있는데, 블랙하울 부족이 되라고요? 생각만 해도 끔찍하네요...","source_cn":"我有我自己的氏族。要做黑嚎的族人？这件事只是想想，就让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0710B809C2CA8A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110410021:1":{"text":"네 부족? 넌 블랙하울 부족 소속이야! 네 전투 재능은 블랙하울의 핏줄에서 물려받은 거라고! 핏줄은 속일 수 없어!","source_cn":"你自己的氏族？你属于黑嚎！你的战斗天分传承自黑嚎的血脉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBF440EA5F2009FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110410022:1":{"text":"네가 마음을 돌리지 않겠다면... 너희는 여기서 한 발자국도 움직일 수 없어!","source_cn":"要是你不肯回头——你们就永远都别想离开这里一步！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B13205D01DDFD43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110410023:1":{"text":"...젠장!","source_cn":"可恶——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x942C004D29BA069B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥格":{"text":"오우거","source":"奥格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":3}}